# 6️⃣ Shortest Path in DAG

Applicable only for:

```text
Directed Acyclic Graph
```

---

## Strategy

Step 1:

```text
Topological Sort
```

Step 2:

```text
Relax Edges
```

in Topological Order.

---

### Why?

Because dependencies are already processed.

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V + E)

Space: O(V)
```

---

# 7️⃣ Edge Relaxation

Most shortest path algorithms use:

```text
Relaxation
```

Formula:

```text
if(
dist[u] + wt
<
dist[v]
)
```

Then:

```text
dist[v]
=
dist[u] + wt
```

---

# 8️⃣ Shortest Path in Unweighted Graph

All edges:

```text
Weight = 1
```

Use:

```text
BFS
```

---

### Example

```text
0 -- 1 -- 2
|
3
```

Shortest distance from 0:

```text
0 → 0

1 → 1

2 → 2

3 → 1
```

---

# 9️⃣ BFS Solution

```cpp
vector<int> shortestPath(
    int N,
    vector<int> adj[],
    int src)
{
    vector<int> dist(
        N,
        1e9
    );

    queue<int> q;

    dist[src] = 0;

    q.push(src);

    while(!q.empty())
    {
        int node = q.front();

        q.pop();

        for(int neighbor :
            adj[node])
        {
            if(
                dist[node] + 1
                <
                dist[neighbor]
            )
            {
                dist[neighbor] =
                    dist[node] + 1;

                q.push(
                    neighbor
                );
            }
        }
    }

    return dist;
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V + E)

Space: O(V)
```

