# 1️⃣5️⃣ Bellman Ford Introduction

Dijkstra fails when:

```text
Negative Edges
```

exist.

Example:

```text
0 → 1 = 5

1 → 2 = -10
```

Use:

```text
Bellman Ford
```

instead.

---

### Bellman Ford Features

✔ Handles Negative Weights

✔ Detects Negative Cycle

✔ Single Source Shortest Path

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V × E)
```

Slower than Dijkstra.

---

# 1️⃣6️⃣ Dijkstra vs BFS

| BFS | Dijkstra |
|-------|----------|
| Unweighted Graph | Weighted Graph |
| Queue | Min Heap |
| O(V+E) | O(E log V) |
| Weight = 1 | Weight ≥ 0 |

---

# 1️⃣7️⃣ Dijkstra vs Bellman Ford

| Dijkstra | Bellman Ford |
|------------|------------|
| Faster | Slower |
| No Negative Edges | Supports Negative Edges |
| O(E log V) | O(VE) |
| No Negative Cycle Detection | Detects Negative Cycle |

