# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Dijkstra requires non-negative weights.

✅ BFS gives shortest path in unweighted graphs.

✅ Kahn's Algorithm can detect directed cycles.

✅ Relaxation is the core concept of shortest path algorithms.

✅ Learn Dijkstra thoroughly for interviews.

